UPDATE posts SET content = content || '<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>What is the minimum order for branded hoodies in South Africa?</h3><p>Our minimum is just 10 units per design for DTF and embroidery, which suits most SME winter gifting runs. Screen printing only becomes cost-effective above 200 units of the same artwork and colourway.</p><h3>How long does a bulk hoodie order take?</h3><p>Standard turnaround from our Mbombela workshop is 7–10 working days for orders up to 200 units, including print, quality-check and nationwide courier. Rush production is available on request for corporate deadlines and event dates.</p><h3>Can you match Pantone colours on hoodies?</h3><p>Yes — for embroidery we match Madeira thread swatches to your brand Pantone, and for DTF we colour-profile artwork before printing so the final decoration lands within 2–3 Delta-E of your brand guideline.</p>' WHERE id='cd5a1a5c-0869-41a2-b6b6-9334bf6ea0e1';